#. fr: rouleau de fibre renforcée du clair de lune
#. column 2: spools of moonshine twine
#. column 8: A luminous thread produced at the High Crucible of<br>Al-Kimiya, used to enhance the properties of lunar envoy's vestments in a thoroughly normal fashion. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
