#. ja: 月光の硬化薬
#. de: Phiole[p] Mondlicht-Poliermittel
#. fr: fiole d'agent solidifiant du clair de lune
#. column 2: pots of moonshine shine
#. column 8: A luminous substance produced at the High Crucible of Al-Kimiya, used to polish lunar envoy's accessories to transcendent perfection. Through copious trial and error, the chances of accoutrements enhanced in such a manner blinding those who look upon them has been reduced to nearly zero. However, advances in crafting technology have rendered it obsolete.
#. column 9: Moonshine Shine
msgctxt "Item:38388:0:0"
msgid "pot of moonshine shine"
msgstr ""

