#. column 2: Abyssos weapon coffers (IL 635)
#. column 8: A stygian chest containing an Abyssos weapon.<br><br>Required level: 90. IL: 635. Weapon type determined by current job or class at time of opening. Cannot be opened in instanced areas such as dungeons, PvP areas, or raids.
